              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "abafado — \"muggy, stuffy, close\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hoje o tempo está abafado. The weather is muggy today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A room with no air is also abafado."
